"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack [完整支持]</a></p><p>[1.21.1] EpicFight 21.16.1<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries?page=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries [完整支持]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack [完整支持]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 Backpack [80%]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG BackPacks [完整支持]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked [完整支持]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks [完整支持]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n SpellBooks [仅书籍]</a> + [所有附加模组]</p><p>需要较长时间制作的模组：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics+所有附加模组 [完成35%]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L Ender's Cataclysm [完成0%]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts [完成0%]</a></p><p>原因是其渲染和3D模型</p><p>（其余模组将根据需求量决定是否支持）</p><p>该模组既修复了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios?page=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a>在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>中的正确渲染，又增加了对其的支持。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389133/description_7307f780-e248-4e89-b144-b3d9643a7dd8.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=